e rigorous, layered struggle of the brushstroke, whereas Y’s \"drip\" technique became the global symbol of radical, spontaneous creation. The two famously sparred over the direction of modern art. Y, a man of relatively few words, often dismissed the idea of an \"isolated American painting,\" while X continued to wrestle with the history of Western art. Their rivalry defined the era’s \"action painting\" discourse. Id X and Y.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:00Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Kooning", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:11Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Picasso", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:16Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Willem de Kooning is X", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:16Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Hooper?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:30Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Pollock", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:30Z", "username": "Anurag Bhide", "text": "Pollock?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:30Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "pollock", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:32Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "jackson", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:33Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Jackson", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T17:28:42Z",